How to Run - News Sentiment Analyzer

1. Navigate to the News-Sentiment-Analyzer directory:
   cd News-Sentiment-Analyzer

2. Install the Python dependencies:
   pip install -r requirements.txt

3. (Optional) Run the ETL scraping and sentiment scoring pipeline to prepopulate the database:
   python main.py

4. Start the interactive data visualization dashboard:
   streamlit run dashboard/app.py
